Describe Cyclomatic Complexity as a software testing metrics. Use the concept of Halstead's metrics to compute the program length, program vocabulary, program volume, potential volume, program level, programming effort and time for the following code.
Int x, y, z;
$z = 0;$
$while (x > 0)$
{
$z = z + y;$
$x = x - 1;$
}
$printf("%d", z);$
